/**
 * The client project's own repository files: README, docs/, GitHub CI and .env.example (PLAN §8a).
 *
 * Every file starts with a "Generated by wp2emdash scaffold" marker. A rerun rewrites marked files and leaves a file
 * alone once someone deletes the marker (the client or developer has taken it over). Content comes from the site
 * config, the IR and the generated forms; nothing here is client-specific in the kit itself.
 */
